// Direct-damage terrain burst at a target point (sheet range 120ft -> 37m, a 20-foot cube
// approximated as a 3m-radius sphere, matching the same cube->sphere approximation already used
// elsewhere in this folder). Plain damage GroundAoe -- no dexterity-save-for-half system exists
// in this engine, so the "half damage on a successful reaction" rider is dropped rather than
// half-modeled.
GroundAoe(
    energy_cost: 78.0,
    buildup_duration: 0.6,
    delay: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    max_range: 37.0,
    radius: 3.0,
    min_falloff: 0.4,
    damage: 45,
    poise: 10,
    knockback: (strength: 8, direction: Away),
    dodgeable: Roll,
    reagent: None,
    rooted_cast: false,
    meta: (school: Some(Transmutation), source: Some(Primordial), cooldown: Some(20.0)),
)
